model.en:
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["s3:GetObject", "s3:PutObject"],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::reports-prod/uploads/*"
    }
  ]
}

Key points: Action lists only GetObject and PutObject (read + write), NOT s3:* and NOT s3:DeleteObject. Resource is the object ARN scoped to the one bucket and the uploads/ prefix with a trailing /* — not arn:aws:s3:::reports-prod (the bucket itself), not arn:aws:s3:::* (all buckets), and not *. This is least privilege: exactly the two actions on exactly the one prefix. (If the app also needs to list that prefix, add a separate statement for s3:ListBucket on arn:aws:s3:::reports-prod with a Condition on s3:prefix — but the requirement as stated needs only object read/write.)

